      "sourceTextSha256": "4563a0878a8e9fccabb670ddf5184af34e7d18504d8dffd0aaf132b6082804e0",
      "text": "After breakfast, leave early for Quilotoa. The main activity is a hike around the crater lake, which takes about 6–7 hours.\n\nQuilotoa lies inside the crater of an extinct volcano. The colour of the water shifts from green to turquoise depending on the light and weather. The trail follows the caldera rim, with changing views of the lake and surrounding mountains.",
